+# CLAUDE.md
+
+This file provides guidance to Claude Code (claude.ai/code) when working with code in this repository.
+
+## Project
+
+`shop-api` — a TypeScript API. The repo is currently minimal: `src/money.ts` is the only source file. `package.json` declares scripts but no dependencies yet, so `tsx`, `vitest`, and `eslint` must be installed before the scripts will run.
+
+## Commands
+
+- `npm run dev` — run `src/index.ts` in watch mode via `tsx` (note: `src/index.ts` does not exist yet)
+- `npm test` — run the test suite once with Vitest
+- `npx vitest run path/to/file.test.ts` — run a single test file; add `-t "test name"` to filter by test name
+- `npm run lint` — ESLint over the whole repo
+
+Run `npm test` before pushing. CI also runs lint, so run `npm run lint` too.
+
+## Team rules (from CONTRIBUTING.md)
+
+- **Money is always integer cents.** Use the `Cents` type from `src/money.ts`; never represent money as floats or decimal amounts.
+- **Migrations:** never edit a migration that has already shipped. Add a new migration instead.
+- **`legacy/` is frozen.** Only security fixes are allowed there. (The directory doesn't exist yet; the rule applies once it does.)
